[RIGGAN]
That was twenty years before I put on that damned costume.
ນັ້ນແມ່ນສິບປີກ່ອນທີ່ຂ້ອຍໃສ່ຊຸດນັ້ນ.

928
00:56:32,650 --> 00:56:34,650
[TABITHA]
I don't care.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈ.

929
